codex
Session 3 gives the same result under selective and full invalidation. It still checks that the target page was invalidated, so it is useful, but it cannot catch over-invalidation.

The selective path clears individual cache entries. I’m checking the address mask and cache indices to ensure the proposed second page survives both invalidation and the subsequent loads.
